Package: pbn
Title: House Layout and Checks for Analysis Projects
Version: 2026.11.21
Authors@R:
    c(
      person(
        given = c("Richard", "Aubrey"),
        family = "White",
        email = "hello@rwhite.no",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6747-1726")
      )
    )
Description: Holds the house layout of a versioned analysis project and
    the checks of that layout. It starts one scenario of a project version
    with the house defaults of 'org', computes the numbers of a descriptive
    table, writes and reads one results object with a fixed contract, and
    runs the real data and each fake scenario in new R sessions.
